'''Nosaurians''' were a horned<ref name="The Phantom Menace" /> [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> that was [[Homeworld|native]] to [[New Plympto]]<ref name="Alien Archive" /> and had [[Color|red]] [[eye]]s and orange, white, and yellow skin.<ref name="The Phantom Menace" /> They were mainly found in [[forest]]ed environments.<ref name="TVE" /> They were considered ill-tempered, and often refused to communicate in [[Galactic Basic Standard]].<ref name="Alien Archive" /> They would instead converse in [[Nosaurian (language)|their native language]], which consisted of loud barking and hissing.<ref name="Alien Archive" /><ref name="Faster" />

Some Nosaurians possessed acute reflexes that allowed them to participate in dangerous high-speed [[racing]] such as [[podracing]] and [[Riot Racing|riot racing]].<ref name="The Phantom Menace" /><ref name="Faster" /> [[Clegg Holdfast]], a [[Gender|male]] Nosaurian, was a [[Podracer (profession)|podracer]] who doubled as a [[journalist]] for ''[[Podracing Quarterly]]'' in the last [[Standard decade|decades]] of the [[Galactic Republic]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> [[Jet Venim]] was another male of the species who was a [[Riot Racing|riot racer]] on the [[planet]] [[Serolonis]] following the birth of the [[Galactic Empire]], and was a recurring champion of the [[Safa Toma Classic]].<ref name="Faster" />

